    "reviews": "\u201cLil\u2019 Sherman is nothing new\u2026 But executed pretty well! Tower Defence games when you actively participate in the actual combat are not rare nowadays, but it still takes effort and a good idea to make it enjoyable, and Lil\u2019 Sherman does it well enough, a pleasant, dynamic mix of a good theme, cute tanks and nice-looking levels where elevation plays an actual, real role in the flow of combat.\u201d<br>7 \u2013 Tiny Gaming<br>",
